 "notes": "Source: output/ranked-bases-2026-10-24/Screenshot 2026-10-24 130126.png; supplied real TH16 ranked-base screenshot from a YouTube video. Video URL not supplied. Projection: screen_x = 987.5 + (x-y)*16.392493; screen_y = 51.0 + (x+y)*12.29029. Coordinates are the top tile of each footprint on the 44x44 village. Tile spacing refined from 16 matched pairs of repeated building sprites; relative displacement RMS 0.424 pixels. Absolute origin checked against wall posts and footprints at the top, both sides, and bottom. 94 visible buildings: full TH16 building inventory except the five Hidden Teslas. No Teslas or traps were visible, so none are invented. 325 wall tiles; initial automatic detector output retained in walls-auto.json; reviewed wall set in walls.json. Wall caps at (19,10), (19,11), and (31,31) are covered by Hero Hall / Monolith artwork and restored by continuity of the visible wall runs. Other manual wall additions fill caps or short rail sections obscured by Archer Tower, Air Defense, Inferno Tower, or Multi-Archer Tower artwork. See wall-review.json. Visible defense settings: Inferno Towers at (15,30), (30,15), (35,35) have clustered multi-target heads; both Spell Towers hold purple Rage bottles; Crafting Station at (21,14) is a Cake-A-Pult. Geared Archer Tower (26,9), geared Cannon (41,21), and three-tube geared Mortar (24,41). Sweeper directions W at (18,27) and N at (27,18) use repository world directions, which render up-left and up-right on screen. Uncertain: all four X-Bow target modes are not confidently distinguishable from this still image and are deliberately left unset; coordinates (5,20), (20,5), (18,35), (35,18). Tall or irregular artwork makes Workshop (11,4) and Dark Barracks (38,5) footprint origins less certain (approximately one tile). The three occluded wall caps listed above are inferred rather than directly seen. CC panel: x3 Headhunter, x2 Archer, x2 Ice Golem; 50 total housing. Four hero banners show Archer Queen, Barbarian King, Grand Warden, and Minion Prince. TH16 has no Guardian. Confidence: high for inventory, CC troops, grid spacing, and most building coordinates; medium for the two irregular building origins and occluded wall caps; X-Bow modes unresolved. No combat calibration is claimed. Digitized from a screenshot; positions about +-1 tile; traps placed by heuristic (not visible in screenshots); built with the user's levels. Hidden Teslas not visible in the screenshot: 5 placed inside the walls at [(10, 14), (38, 18), (18, 38), (23, 21), (12, 27)] (assumed).",
